# Vite/Vitest write these next to the config while resolving it and unlink them
# when they are done. Reached through a folder mount that cannot unlink, they
# are left behind — build scratch, never a change, and they have now stopped a
# landing gate twice by turning up as untracked files nobody put there.
*.timestamp-*.mjs
